id: zw_legacy_api
label: Z-Wave Legacy API Compatibility
category: Z-Wave
description: >
  Provides compatibility implementations for Z-Wave SDK APIs that have been
  superseded or require transitional support. The implementations preserve
  source and link compatibility for applications migrated from earlier SDK
  releases while allowing the SDK to evolve independently. This component
  provides a dedicated location for compatibility code whose lifecycle may
  differ from that of the current SDK interfaces.
package: zwave
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    reference: zw_sbom_license
requires:
- name: zw_versions
provides:
- name: zw_legacy_api
source:
- path: "platform/SiliconLabs/components/zw_legacy_api/zw_legacy_api_8.2.c"
root_path: zwave
